# Auto-generated GLB files from gltf-pipeline conversion.
# Character models: keep as .gltf + .bin (GLB embeds textures = 15-40 MB each).
# Props: same issue (Banner_1.glb ~21 MB, Barrel.glb ~14 MB).
# Weapons GLBs are kept (35-40 KB each, no embedded textures issue).
# DELETE these from disk: packages/client/public/characters/*.glb (except UAL1_Standard.glb)
# DELETE these from disk: packages/client/public/arena/props/Banner_1.glb, Barrel.glb, Crate_Wooden.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Female_Peasant.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Female_Ranger.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Female_Ranger_Head_Hood.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Hair_Buns.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Hair_Buzzed.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Hair_Long.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Hair_SimpleParted.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Male_Peasant.glb
packages/client/public/characters/Male_Ranger.glb
